{
  "name": "ondra-life-rhythm",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的生活层与作息（手册 §3.7 + §3.3）：一边是她自己过日子——六类活动、兴趣权重与标签（烧脑/放松/创造）、10% 概率探索新兴趣、心情差时优先放松型、做一次加权、长期没碰按半衰期衰减、笔记分长期与临时；一边是能量积分——清醒 +0.2/min、深睡或深夜 +1/min、自然上限 60、喂到 100 按 0.1/min 回落、急停期间冻结、5 分钟一片分段积分、睡醒缓冲取走即清零。只有一个由时钟驱动的 tick，没有子进程、没有常驻循环，卸载即停。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
